        <li class="flex gap-2.5"><span class="shrink-0 text-sun-400">✓</span> We'll say if a worker is the cheaper answer, and it usually is</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2.5"><span class="shrink-0 text-sun-400">✓</span> No sales sequence, no drip campaign</li>
